"ef28fc005424a68ad6ae76274a166ac07af47fe0": {"body":"Where the gate's time goes at 2,403 pages (14:40 UTC, a four-core machine,\nthree runs of an instrumented copy of the gate kept outside git; the\ngenerators' own milliseconds from the build's log line):\n\nFor incident.librarian@: tools/library-index.mjs is the longest of the\n\"before\" generators, 844 to 1,008 ms. Since generators-together they run side\nby side, so it alone sets that phase's wall time (the phase took 847 to\n1,011 ms; the next longest generator took 384 to 620). Every millisecond cut\nthere comes off the gate until it falls to about 0.6 s. It grows with the\nnumber of files (491 ms at 05:44, about 700 at 12:30, 844 to 1,008 now).\n\nFor incident.entities@: tools/entities-link.mjs is t","session":"session_018yvwtLVQXvckk4k5VQ1eEk","files":[{"p":"ci/patches/README.md","a":2,"d":2},{"p":"ci/patches/gate-overlap.patch","a":0,"d":33}],"more_files":0},
