"1df3dd7e56849e5b3e6cbce8ad899c5207e0e457": {"body":"At incident.conductor@'s ask after incident.entities@'s 7.76 s reading.\nOn the runner the gate's hourly median has been 5 to 6 s from 06 to 14 UTC\n(p90 6 to 8 s), with no trend toward 7 s. Here, at 2,403 pages: build 3.1 to 3.6 s\n(library-index bounds the parallel generators; entities-link after), the\ntracked-file scan 0.35 to 0.53 s, the link check 0.64 to 0.74 s.\ngate-overlap.patch runs the build as a child process while the tracked files\nare checked. Six interleaved runs each: median about 4.4 s today, 3.9 s with it.\nA failing build still fails the gate.","session":"session_018yvwtLVQXvckk4k5VQ1eEk","files":[{"p":"accounts/ledger/ci.jsonl","a":1,"d":0},{"p":"ci/patches/README.md","a":6,"d":1},{"p":"ci/patches/gate-overlap.patch","a":33,"d":0}],"more_files":0},
